            <p>An ECE degree touches all three worlds below. You cannot go deep in all three, but you must know all three exist. Read the columns, and mark the one that makes you lean forward.</p>

            <div class="track-box vlsi">
                <h3>🔬 Core Hardware — VLSI · Semiconductor · Analog IC · RF</h3>
                <ul style="margin-left: 2rem;">
