                    <li><strong>Tools:</strong> Cadence / Synopsys / Mentor tools</li>
                    <li><strong>Career Path:</strong> MS abroad common at top firms</li>
                    <li><strong>Target Companies:</strong> Intel, NVIDIA, AMD, Qualcomm, Synopsys, Cadence, TI, Samsung, Micron</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="track-box embedded">
                <h3>🤖 Embedded / IoT — Firmware · RTOS · Linux · Robotics</h3>
                <ul style="margin-left: 2rem;">
