                    <li><strong>Target Companies:</strong> Bosch, Siemens, NXP, ST, Infineon, TI, Qualcomm MCU</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="track-box software">
                <h3>💻 Software / SDE — Backend · ML · Quant · Systems</h3>
                <ul style="margin-left: 2rem;">
                    <li><strong>Skills:</strong> DSA + one strong language, System design (LLD + HLD)</li>
