        <!-- 4-Year Roadmap Section -->
        <section id="roadmap">
            <h2>The 4-Year Semester-by-Semester Roadmap</h2>

            <h3>Semester 1: Foundations — Settle In, Build Habits</h3>
            <div class="semester-box">
                <div class="semester-title">Focus: ~40h/week | Readiness: 10%</div>
                <div class="semester-desc">Mathematics 1, Basic Electrical, Physics, Programming in C</div>
                
                <h4>Skills to Learn</h4>
                <div class="skill-item">Typing speed > 40 WPM, VS Code, Linux basics (Ubuntu / WSL)</div>
                <div class="skill-item">Git & GitHub — first commits, first repo</div>
                <div class="skill-item">Breadboarding, resistor color codes, DMM usage</div>
                
                <h4>Projects (Pick 2)</h4>
                <div class="project-item">• Blinking LED with 555 timer on breadboard</div>
                <div class="project-item">• Simple calculator in C (menu-driven)</div>
                <div class="project-item">• 7-segment display counter (with switches)</div>
                
                <div class="readiness-bar">
                    <div class="readiness-fill" style="width: 10%;">10%</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h3>Semester 2: C Mastery + First Electronics Lab</h3>
            <div class="semester-box">
                <div class="semester-title">Focus: ~40h/week | Readiness: 18%</div>
                <div class="semester-desc">Mathematics 2, Electronic Devices, Digital Logic Design, Data Structures</div>
                
                <h4>Skills to Learn</h4>
                <div class="skill-item">C pointers, malloc, structs (interview gold)</div>
                <div class="skill-item">Bash scripting basics, Makefiles</div>
                <div class="skill-item">KiCad / EasyEDA — draw your first schematic</div>
                <div class="skill-item">Start LeetCode Easy — target 50 problems</div>
                
                <h4>Projects</h4>
                <div class="project-item">• Digital clock on 4-digit 7-seg + 555</div>
                <div class="project-item">• Bank account manager in C using structs + file I/O</div>
                <div class="project-item">• Logic gates using transistors (breadboard)</div>
                
                <div class="readiness-bar">
                    <div class="readiness-fill" style="width: 18%;">18%</div>
